<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia yr-on-yr car sales up 36.03 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Malaysia yr-on-yr car sales up 36.03 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger car sales in Malaysia jumped 36.03 percent in November this year to 24,897 units from 18,303 in November 1995, the Malaysian Motor Traders Association (MMTA) said.</p>
<p>Sales of commercial vehicles rose 45.86 percent to 8,047 units from 5,517 in November last year, the MMTA said in its monthly review of the domestic auto industry.</p>
</text>
